# Measured on the full HTTP gate of 2026-10-27 (261 steps in 55m05s, same box, other sessions running), plus reruns.
# checkpoint-store: row 4c rewinds 120-file and 60-long-name fixtures through the real runner capped at 1500 bytes —
# measured standalone on 2026-10-30 (lane checkpoint-links): 50 s and 72 s at 2d1c2fb9 (r3 review, 22% and 74% CPU),
# 33 s with the undo closure, and 144 s and 189 s with other gates holding the CPU at 100%; 127 s and 82 s at undo
# review 1's fix, other gates running; 54 s and 50 s at undo review 2's fix, about 90% CPU; 39 s and 43 s at undo
# review 3's fix, 40-57% CPU (its row 12 now checks this entry); 51 s at 65% CPU and 159 s at 100% at undo review 4's;
# 114 s at 100% at undo review 5's; 99 s with another gate running at undo review 6's, 78 s at 100% beside another gate
# on 2026-11-01, after the reboot; 75 s at 51% beside another session's fast gate at undo review 9's fix (2026-11-02);
# undo review 10 measured 37ab3794's at 69.5 s at 48%, and 61 s at 37% beside two other gates at its fix. Undo review 12 cut it off at
